WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:04.330
Speaker 1: All right, this is a wild story
that some people are actually finding themselves

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:06.350
sort of sort of triggered by.

00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:12.710
There is a MSNBC TV analyst named Malcolm
Nance, and he's been around for a while now,

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:18.530
a former intelligence guy, kind of a well,
well known in the space at this point in time.

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:21.270
He has actually joined the fight in Ukraine.

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:22.270
He is.

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:27.070
He is fighting in Ukraine, at least to some
extent, against the Russian invasion.

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:28.560
And this is fascinating.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:38.329
And without becoming sort of like a war pawn
advocate, this is someone putting their sort

00:00:38.329 --> 00:00:43.130
of money or their time, at least where their
mouth is.

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:44.660
There's a report from The Denver Gazette.

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:49.190
MSNBC analyst Malcolm Nance reveals he joined
the fight in Ukraine.

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:54.110
Malcolm Nance, an author and former military
intelligence analyst, appeared for an interview

00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:58.739
Monday with MSNBC host Joy Reid, who said
he was at a secure location.

00:00:58.739 --> 00:01:03.340
Nance was dressed in military garb and holding
a rifle, said he joined Ukraine's foreign

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:07.700
legion about a month ago to fend off what
he called Russia's war of extermination.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.260
I have a little bit of that interview.

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:12.780
Let's check it out and you will notice if
you're watching Malcolm Nance is wearing.

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:14.850
I don't want to use the wrong term.

00:01:14.850 --> 00:01:18.130
I guess we'll just call it military garb,
and he's holding a weapon as well.

00:01:18.130 --> 00:01:22.010
Speaker 2: Joining me now from a secure location
in western Ukraine is Malcolm Nance, executive

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:24.000
director of the Terror Isometrics project.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:29.220
He's fighting with the International Legion
of Territorial Defense of Ukraine and Malcolm.

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:35.030
We just watched that video of you and Ali
RUSI was attempting to interview you for us

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:37.100
to get more information on what you're doing.

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:39.670
We saw those cruise missiles fly overhead.

00:01:39.670 --> 00:01:44.340
So explain to us why you are there and what
you are doing.

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:50.259
Speaker 3: Well, as you know, I spent quite
a bit of time here in the pre-war period,

00:01:50.259 --> 00:01:54.330
and when the invasion happened, I had friends
who were in Donetsk, who were in the Ukrainian

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:58.079
army, who were writing to us and telling us
We're not going to survive tonight.

00:01:58.079 --> 00:02:00.399
We've been hit five hundred times.

00:02:00.399 --> 00:02:02.320
You know, these are graduates of Defense Language
Institute.

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:04.190
These are my friends.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:09.409
And you know, as the more I saw of the war
going on, the more I thought, I'm done talking.

00:02:09.409 --> 00:02:11.700
All right, it's time to take action here.

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:18.900
So about a month ago, I joined the International
Legion here in Ukraine, and I am here to help

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:20.510
this country fight.

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:26.420
You know what essentially is a war of its
of extermination.

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:29.099
This is an existential war.

00:02:29.099 --> 00:02:32.890
And Russia has bought it to these people and
they are mass murdering civilians.

00:02:32.890 --> 00:02:36.599
And there are people here like me who are
here to do something about it.

00:02:36.599 --> 00:02:42.041
Speaker 1: So there's some on the left who
have reacted to this by saying, Oh God, the

00:02:42.041 --> 00:02:48.689
glorification of Malcolm Nance doing this
is war porn.

00:02:48.689 --> 00:02:50.389
It's glorifying violence.

00:02:50.389 --> 00:02:55.400
It's pro-war to say what a great thing that
Malcolm Nance is doing.

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:56.680
I don't see it that way.

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:59.049
Nance is sixty one.

00:02:59.049 --> 00:03:05.110
He could just stay with his cushy MSNBC gig,
and I'm guessing he does consulting and speaking

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:07.139
and all these different things.

00:03:07.139 --> 00:03:08.590
He is at least theoretically.

00:03:08.590 --> 00:03:12.840
I mean, listen, you know, if you come back
and you tell me Nance isn't really exposed

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:16.650
to any danger, this is all a setup he put
on a uniform and he's there, but he's in like

00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:18.469
the part of the country where nothing's going
on.

00:03:18.469 --> 00:03:21.189
OK, well, I mean, like, listen, there's no
evidence of that, but I'm sure someone would

00:03:21.189 --> 00:03:22.189
make that claim.

00:03:22.189 --> 00:03:24.549
But at least in theory he is.

00:03:24.549 --> 00:03:28.669
He's there and he's putting himself at risk.

00:03:28.669 --> 00:03:33.419
And he believes that this is a war of aggression
by Russia against Ukraine, that Ukraine is

00:03:33.419 --> 00:03:35.640
fighting a defensive war.

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:40.989
And along those lines, if you are in a position
to have to defend your country and by proxy,

00:03:40.989 --> 00:03:42.939
that's what Malcolm Nance is doing.

00:03:42.939 --> 00:03:48.000
You're not pro-war because you say, Wow, he's
actually in the real world doing the thing

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:53.310
that many of us just sit in front of microphones
and say, this is the side that I'm on for

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:54.969
lack of a better term.

00:03:54.969 --> 00:04:00.529
So seeing this and saying that the other aspect
to this is there's a there's a big I don't

00:04:00.529 --> 00:04:01.930
want to call it big.

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:12.019
There's a loud movement on the online left,
which is very just black and white, antagonistic

00:04:12.019 --> 00:04:15.819
against any government or intelligence agency.

00:04:15.819 --> 00:04:18.290
And they haven't liked Malcolm Nance for a
long time.

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:22.000
They say this guy is the epitome of the.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:27.270
Sometimes they'll even use the term deep state
or of the establishment intel that got Iraq

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:29.990
wrong, and they got this wrong and they got
that wrong.

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:38.720
And so they see this as the sort of worst
of the worst meshing of American intelligence

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:46.740
and corporate media and pro-war Democrats
or whatever you want to say.

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:48.639
I really just don't see it that way.

00:04:48.639 --> 00:04:51.470
I am as anti-war as anybody else.

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:57.430
This is a defensive war for Ukraine, and he
is at least to some degree, putting his money

00:04:57.430 --> 00:04:58.710
where his mouth is.

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:01.150
It's not a glorification of war like a war
movie.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.020
I just don't see it that way.

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:08.009
If you disagree and you think that is what
this Malcolm Nance thing is, then I want to

00:05:08.009 --> 00:06:23.080
hear from you.

